---
import { EVENT_EVERYDAY_QUESTIONS } from '@lib/event-landing';

/**
 * "Vielleicht kennst du das" — recognition before explanation.
 *
 * The home page explains what a Männerkreis is. This section does the opposite:
 * it describes an ordinary week and lets the reader notice himself in it, so the
 * evening has something to connect to before a single thing is claimed about it.
 * Typography does the work here — no cards, no icons.
 *
 * Note the full stop inside the italic span in the heading: `.text-italic`
 * carries a negative inline-start margin, so a period left outside it renders
 * visibly detached from the word.
 */
---

<section class="section event-landing-everyday" aria-labelledby="alltag-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="event-landing-everyday__layout">
      <div class="event-landing-everyday__intro" data-reveal-group="90">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal="up">Vielleicht kennst du das</p>
        <h2 class="section-title event-landing-everyday__title" id="alltag-title" data-reveal="blur">
          Im Alltag funktioniert vieles. Aber nicht alles bekommt <span class="text-italic">Raum.</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="event-landing-everyday__staccato" data-reveal="up">
          Arbeit. Familie. Beziehung. Entscheidungen. Verantwortung.
        </p>

        <div class="event-landing-everyday__text" data-reveal="up">
          <p>Vieles davon machen wir erst einmal mit uns selbst aus.</p>
          <p>
            Nicht, weil niemand da wäre. Sondern weil Gespräche unter Männern oft schnell bei Arbeit, Alltag, Sport oder
            beim nächsten Ratschlag landen.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="event-landing-everyday__questions" data-reveal-group="90">
        <p class="event-landing-everyday__lead-in" data-reveal="up">
          Im Männerkreis darf es einmal um das gehen, was darunter liegt.
        </p>
        <ul class="event-landing-everyday__list" role="list">
          {
            EVENT_EVERYDAY_QUESTIONS.map((question) => (
              <li class="event-landing-everyday__question" data-reveal="up">
                {question}
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="event-landing-everyday__close" data-reveal="up">
      Du musst darauf keine fertigen Antworten haben. <span class="text-italic">Du kannst einfach kommen.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  @layer sections {
    .event-landing-everyday__layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-lg) var(--space-xl);
      align-items: start;

      @media (width <= 900px) {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-lg);
      }
    }

    .event-landing-everyday__title {
      max-inline-size: 18ch;
      text-wrap: balance;
    }

    .event-landing-everyday__staccato {
      margin-block: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 0.9rem + 1.4vw, 1.875rem);
      font-style: italic;
      line-height: 1.35;
      color: var(--text-accent);
      text-wrap: balance;
    }

    .event-landing-everyday__text {
      max-inline-size: var(--content-max-text);
      font-size: var(--text-section-body);
      line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      text-wrap: pretty;

      & p {
        margin-block-end: var(--space-sm);
      }
    }

    .event-landing-everyday__questions {
      padding-inline-start: var(--space-md);
      border-inline-start: 1px solid var(--border-medium);

      @media (width <= 900px) {
        padding-inline-start: 0;
        border-inline-start: none;
      }
    }

    .event-landing-everyday__lead-in {
      margin-block-end: var(--space-sm);
      font-size: var(--text-section-body);
      line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      text-wrap: pretty;
    }

    .event-landing-everyday__list {
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .event-landing-everyday__question {
      padding-block: var(--space-sm);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1rem + 1vw, 1.75rem);
      line-height: 1.3;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      border-block-start: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      text-wrap: pretty;

      &:first-child {
        border-block-start: none;
        padding-block-start: 0;
      }
    }

    .event-landing-everyday__close {
      max-inline-size: var(--content-max-wide);
      margin-block-start: var(--space-lg);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 1rem + 1.4vw, 2.125rem);
      line-height: 1.35;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      text-wrap: balance;
    }

    .event-landing-everyday__close .text-italic {
      color: var(--accent-text);
    }
  }
</style>
